          "text": "Left lower-leg ulcer surrounding skin"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Mild erythema and warmth limited to a 0.5–1 cm rim, consistent with irritant or venous stasis change; no clear spreading cellulitis."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-10",
